title: TUR Courses
subtitle: Courses of the Workers' University Society; each goes where it is most needed.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_party_rules && PolishParty.turCardAvailable(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card party.tur_courses (Z — 0.78, decision 5A of 8 X 2026): the courses of TUR left the party agenda for a card of their own,
// in the Party deck once TUR works. Each course is one click: this month's action and 1 R, two months of work, one course at a
// time and then four months before the next (13.2); the target is chosen by PolishParty.courseTarget. Z — 0.91 (decisions
// 2A–5A of 24 X 2026): three courses; the civic courses raise the trust in PPS of their groups, and the card speaks plainly.
PolishParty.turCardView(Q);
!}

= TUR courses

The Workers' University Society runs reading rooms, libraries and courses for workers, and people who learn with us trust the party more. A course costs this month's action and 1 resource, and its result shows after two months.

- @civil_rights
- @union_cadres
- @national_education
- @easy_discard

@civil_rights
title: Run a civic course
subtitle: [+ pl_tur_civil_rights_target +] Trust in PPS in this group rises for good (+4), so our campaigns reach it better.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.courseStatus(Q, 'civil_rights', PolishParty.courseTarget(Q, 'civil_rights')).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_tur_civil_rights_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.turCardCourse(Q, 'civil_rights');
!}
go-to: result

@union_cadres
title: Run a course for trade unionists
subtitle: [+ pl_tur_union_cadres_target +] The union trusts PPS more (+3) and objects less (−4).
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.courseStatus(Q, 'union_cadres', PolishParty.courseTarget(Q, 'union_cadres')).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_tur_union_cadres_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.turCardCourse(Q, 'union_cadres');
!}
go-to: result

@national_education
title: Run a national education campaign
subtitle: [+ pl_tur_national_education_target +] Trust in PPS rises in all three groups (+4).
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.courseStatus(Q, 'national_education', PolishParty.courseTarget(Q, 'national_education')).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_tur_national_education_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.turCardCourse(Q, 'national_education');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

